<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Sumau Garia Bible - Unicode</book>
  <para style="h">2 Ts</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Ts</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ts</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Tesalonaika</para>
  <para style="ide"/>
  <para style="rem"/>
  <para style="rem"/>
  <para style="h"/>
  <para style="mt2">Xoka Axiri nakau</para>
  <para style="mt">Polue Tesalonaika xosaniki xayawotai</para>
  <para style="imt">Akereki kuna</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu Tesalonaika erewese puroteneaie Kristusu xiyeri kopina yause xosa amu sapini kutu yaraxepinana xineri xokupa nanunanu teteneai. Kireue ipaki kunauneri Kokaipapu Asau itou kotai xeteneai. Pa xati Polu nuko xeika Sailasino Timotino xeikae ninipo nanunanu kutuwopure mua nakau xayawoteneai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Polue ipaki kunauna pa Asau putawati xana xemu xetai. Ximuximua xuimiapimie xiri poripori ereria xokupa xoxixoxi kapia paie pani sokisoki xepina. Kakeria kire apu tu sokau porowopinae mana paiya, Kristusu xiri xiwaiwopina.</para>
  <para style="ip">Xuiapue xonikisu xosa sokisoki tumuneri xu xemeropinerire Polue kaniketai. Nuko xeika saina emeumana xeikae kakirouneri sie, nini niko yakunikepi saina sokisoki tepineri xetai. Nini saina tepure ouyexeni nini kireu tianikepure ouyexeni.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="ms">Kokaipapu Asau sewai putawopina</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="2TH 1-2">1—2</ref></para>
  <para style="d"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Sini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">YT 17.1</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 1:1">1 Ts 1.1</ref></char></note> Polu xuno Sailasi xuno Timoti xuno, sinie tini Yesusure xotikisukiriai xuiapu Tesalonaika erewese purikiriai xosa mua nakau xayaritikinuku, paiya tini xuiapue sikou Emisiki Xoiteu xeika Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusu xeika etokipurikiriai.<verse eid="2TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Xoiteu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:7">Ro 1.7</ref></char></note> sikou Emisiki xeika, Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusu xeikae xonikisuaxati xonikietikeria tini xotiki kurunari purakuai.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tesalonaika apimie xu yause sokisoki tumurouneri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Yewapu xura<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:2-3">1 Ts 1.2-3</ref>;<ref loc="2TH 2:13">2 Ts 2.13</ref></char></note>, xokupa yause sinie tinire nanunanunuku Xoiteu eiyaseurounuku. Sinie panumu kakepinuku xiri asinaku, pa amure, tinipo xotikisue xiri sokisoki xati, tini xokupa kirenikirenie kireu xatatikimana xotikikemu tinikirounuku xati, pa kapiae xiri kokaipa xina. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Pa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:4">2 Ko 7.4</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 7:14">7.14</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 2:19">1 Ts 2.19</ref>;<ref loc="REV 1:9">XKY 1.9</ref></char></note> kapia xotaparei sore, sinie Xoiteure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu xosa xouxanaunukua, tinipo wenitiki xourorirounuku. Xiwaie kakeri xokupa xu tini xosa moyaire sinie nini kanikirounuku. Paire sinie ipaki kunaunuku, “Tesalonaika kinie sokisoki tumuneri ninipo xonikisu soki tineri pa xokupa xu xeika tatau xeika xemeneri,” xirounuku.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xoiteue asinaku kapia xosa uteisikirouna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Pa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:28">Pl 1.28</ref></char></note> xokupa kapia tini xosa motai paiya. Xoiteue asinaku kapiani kutu kireni kakina nukoe sinipo kapia uteipopouna sini panumu atarisiketai. Tini tatau xemekiriaia, pa amure, tinie Xoiteue xuiapu yakunikepina yause sarepurexinukuna, kakaria pa yause xosa Xoiteue atina yakutikepina. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:19">Ro 12.19</ref>;<ref loc="REV 18:6-7">XKY 18.6-7</ref></char></note> muanumu asinaku kapiani kutu kakepina. Apimie tini xu tikirouneri paiya nue xu xapa teritikepina. <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>Kakina<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mt 25.31</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 3:13">1 Ts 3.13</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:16">4.16</ref></char></note> nue pa xu ximine tinie xemekiriai xuweiyeinapa, tini xeika sini xeikani arikepi sikepina. Kokaipa Yesusu xeika nupo xokupa sokisoki xenikorokoro xeikae mena xouro wetineri yarani putawopineri yause xosa Xoiteue panumu kakepina. Nue kokaipa xepireini kutu kounapa <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>apimie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 79:6">Siri 79.6</ref>;<ref loc="ISA 66:15">Ais 66.15</ref>;<ref loc="JER 10:25">Yer 10.25</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 2:8">Ro 2.8</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 4:17">1 Pi 4.17</ref></char></note> Xoiteu sipawopi xiraxineri, Yesusu sikou Kokaipapu asinaku kuna taiwopu xuweuwoteneaia xaro tinikepuwatixana manimani tinikepina. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Pa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Ais 2.10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:19-21">2.19-21</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 3:19">Pl 3.19</ref>;<ref loc="2PE 3:7">2 Pi 3.7</ref></char></note> apimie panumu kakineria xoxiaki xepineri. Ninie Kokaipa xeika nupo sokisoki kokaipa memeremu xeika wetineri, xetauro purineria sipesi sipesi xoxixepineri. <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>Xoiteue iyareyai Asau xosa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:35">Siri 68.35</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:7">89.7</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:4">Kl 3.4</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 3:13">1 Ts 3.13</ref></char></note>, Kokaipae kouna paiya manimani tinikepina, pana Xoiteupo xokupa xuiapu nini xokupae nure xonikisuwoneaia ninie nupo wenumu xourorineria nure xiri nimaririwopineri. Kakeria tinie rania nini xeika nimaririwakuai, pa amure, sinie tini xopu Xoiteupo kuna uteikiri tinie xiri xotikisukiniai.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xoiteue Tesalonaika kini sokisokinikepinaure ninie kunikuniwoteneai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Pa sapi putawopure xetaire nanuworinuku<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:9">Kl 1.9</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 1:2-3">1 Ts 1.2-3</ref></char></note>, sikou Xoiteu kotoukiri tianitikepinaure sinie xokupa yause kunikunirounuku. Tinie kakakuai kapiaure nukoe yaitikeyai xati nukoe pa kapia xiri atina tianitikepinaure sini xinuku. Nue tini sokisoki tikepinaure sinie kunikunirounukuna, tinipo xotikisue kakati tinie xokupa asinaku kapia kakepure xikiniaia kaka. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Pa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:15">Ais 24.15</ref>;<ref loc="MAL 1:11">Mal 1.11</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 1:7">1 Pi 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:14">4.14</ref></char></note> kapia xosa tinie Kokaipa Yesusupo wenumu xourorari nue rania tinipo wenitiki xourorepina. Sikou Xoiteu xeika Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusu xeikae tinire xonikisuaxati xonikietikineria pa xokupa kapia tini xosa kakepineri.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Tu sokau porowopina apu putawopina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Yewapu xura<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:31">Mt 24.31</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 4:13-17">1 Ts 4.13-17</ref></char></note>, sikou Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusue, xiyeri koati sini nu xeika kununuwopure sini ximine kunawopure xinuku. Sinipo mua kuna xosa tini atinari xakutiki iyarakuaire xinuku. <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>Kireu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:4">Mt 24.4</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 5:6">Ep 5.6</ref>;<ref loc="1JN 4:1">1 Yo 4.1</ref></char></note> apimie rau katikineri Kokaipapu Asau putawotai xeteneai. Kire apue rau nanuna Xoiteupo Supo Youyae kunatureture kuna ye sietai xepinare, e kire apue Xoiteupo kuna uteina pa kuna kunaunare, e kire apue kunauna sinie panumu kuna purotai sie xosa nakau xayaukiriai xepina. Pana tinie muanumu kuna anayau rau iyesikiriai xatia, tini sapauni xoxi ure ureuweinari tinipo nanunanu ere xaku. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:12">Yo 17.12</ref>;<ref loc="1TI 4:1">1 Ti 4.1</ref>;<ref loc="1JN 2:18">1 Yo 2.18</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 4:3">4.3</ref>;<ref loc="REV 13:11-14">XKY 13.11-14</ref></char></note> kakixanari kire apu wetari nupo kunare e nuko kaketai kapiaure xoreitikexete. Iyesa. Pa Asau paiya aini mopuwatixe. Xuwe. Xokupa apimie akeri wou erineria Xoiteu nikiniki tuwopineri. Kakeria tu xasese marouna apue yarani mopina, pa apua nu sokisoki xepi xosa xoxixepina. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Apimie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:25">Tan 7.25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:36">11.36</ref>;<ref loc="EZK 28:2">Ese 28.2</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 8:5">1 Ko 8.5</ref>;<ref loc="REV 13:6">XKY 13.6</ref></char></note> xokupa sapi xosa muris tirouneri paiya nue xiwaixiwai nikina ye xoiteu paxinapa weninikepina. Kakina wouerina paiya nukou wenumu xourorina pa xokupa sapi ororepina. Kakina nukoe Xoiteupo ata minika misina paiya, ipaki kuna uteina, “Ye ikoini Xoiteu xepine,” xetai.<verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Ye tini xeika puritiai yause xosa yei tini pa sapire katikieitiai. Tini nanunanu wetikiriaire, wo? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Ximine pa sapie pa apupo ime parawotai tini sipa, kakatia nu sapauni yaraxepuwatixe. Nu yaraxepina yause paiya Xoiteue iyareyai yause xosa nu putawopina. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:18">1 Yo 2.18</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 4:3">4.3</ref></char></note> sipa, ximine paiya tu sokau porowopi kapia ximiaki purina. Nu ximiaki purati paiyeye, pa apu nupo ime parau purotaie kereu xonopina. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Kakatia<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:9">Yop 4.9</ref>;<ref loc="ISA 11:4">Ais 11.4</ref>;<ref loc="DAN 7:10">Tan 7.10</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 10:27">Ip 10.27</ref>;<ref loc="REV 19:15">XKY 19.15</ref></char></note> pa yause xosa pa tu sokau porourouna apue yarani putawopina. Kakatia Kokaipa Yesusue nukou xa youyae ouwatia xumopina. Kokaipae nukou kokaipa memeremu xeika yarani putauna paiya, pa memeremueni pa apu tu sokou porourouna xiri xoxixoxi wopina. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Pa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mt 24.24</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 8:41">Yo 8.41</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:2">Ep 2.2</ref>;<ref loc="REV 13:11-13">XKY 13.11-13</ref></char></note> apu nu tu sokau porowopina paiya Satanipo sokisokie yarani putawopina. Kakinapa Satanipo xorei xorei kapiae xokupa sokisoki saina xeika xonuxonu xeika erepina. <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>Kakina<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:15">2 Ko 2.15</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 4:3">4.3</ref></char></note> paiya xokupa xoxi kapiapu xorei xoreie pa xuiapu xoreinikatia xoxixepineri imerei texepineri. Pa xuiapu nini xoxixepineri, pa amure, Xoiteue kunani kutu tinikepina yause xosa, nini xiyeri sonikepina xati, ninie mua kuna xiri xiraxineri. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:5">Mt 24.5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:11">24.11</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 1:24">Ro 1.24</ref>;<ref loc="1TI 4:1">1 Ti 4.1</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 4:4">2 Ti 4.4</ref></char></note> ninie xoreixorei kunaure xonikisuwopinerire, Xoiteue ninipo nanunanu turutaruwetai. <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:32">Ro 1.32</ref></char></note> xokupa apimie kunani kuture xonikisuwopuxuweuneri, nini xoxi kapia kireni kakepure nimaririwoteneai, nini Xoiteupo kuna xosa tumuwopineri yause xiri manimani tinikepina.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xoiteue tini xiyeri titikepinaure akitutikietai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Pana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:75">Lu 1.75</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 15:16">Yo 15.16</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:4">Ep 1.4</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 4:7">1 Ts 4.7</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:9">5.9</ref>;<ref loc="2TH 1:3">2 Ts 1.3</ref></char></note> xatai xura, Kokaipae tini xiri xouwetikirouna xati sinie sipesi xosikirei nanunanunuku tinire Xoiteu eiyasewopinuku xinuku. Xoiteue xuiapu xiyeri tinikepure xina tinie akereki xuiapu kini xopu xosa purakuaire akitutiketai. Xoiteupo Supo Youyae tini Xoiteu nukou asinaku xuiapu sie akitutiketai xati, tinie suau kuna xotikisuwari, pa kapiarei Xoiteue xiyeri titikina. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Sikou Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusupo kokaipa memeremu xeika sokisoki xeika xosa purakuaire kakina, pa xati, pa asinaku kuna sinie uteikiniai xosa nue tini yaitiketai. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:2">1 Ko 11.2</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 16:13">16.13</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 4:1">Pl 4.1</ref>;<ref loc="2TH 3:6">2 Ts 3.6</ref></char></note>, yewapu xura, tini sokisokini kutu tumuwa. Kakinari Xoiteupo xokupa kuna sinie tini xosa uteikiniaire e taitaitikepure nakau xayaukiniai paiya, tini atinarini kutu taiwa.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Sikou Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusu xeika sikou Emisiki Xoiteu xeikae sini xiri xonikiesikineri. Kakina nupo xousuae xouwesikati sinipo xosikikemu sipesi sipesi yoroni asinaku purina. Kakati xosikisunuku Xoiteu yakukiri xiri atiatisikepinaure tianisikina. <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>Nue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:8">1 Ko 1.8</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 3:13">1 Ts 3.13</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 5:10">1 Pi 5.10</ref></char></note> tinipo xotikikemu sokisokiwati paiya, tinie xokupa asinaku kapia xeika asinaku kuna xeika kunawakuaire tianitikepina.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="ms">Tesalonaika apimie ouyetutua apimi atineri kutunikepineri</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="2TH 3">3</ref></para>
  <para style="d"/>
  <para style="s">Tinie Xoiteu xosa kunikuniwaria sini tianisikepina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Yewapu xura<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:19">Ep 6.19</ref>;<ref loc="COL 4:3">Kl 4.3</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 5:25">1 Ts 5.25</ref></char></note>, sini pani kire kuna tuku. Kuna paiya muai. Xoiteue sini tianisikepinaure tinie kunikuniwari, Kokaipapu kunae xokupa sanawayau oupapaina taki xopu kokaipa wenumu teyai sie tepina. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Apimie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:24">YT 28.24</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 10:16">Ro 10.16</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 15:31">15.31</ref></char></note> xoxixoxi kapia kakirouneri xati, tinie Xoiteu xosa kunikuniwari nue apimi xoxi xupunikiropu sini xiyeri tisikepina. Tini sipa, xokupa apimie Kristusu xosa xonikisuworixe.<verse eid="2TH 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Pana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:15">Yo 17.15</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 1:9">1 Ko 1.9</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 5:24">1 Ts 5.24</ref>;<ref loc="2PE 2:9">2 Pi 2.9</ref></char></note> Kokaipae suau kapiani kutu kakirouna. Pa xati sinie nureni kutu xosikisuwopu itou. Kakari nue tini sokisokitikina yakutikatia, Satanie tini xosa kire kapia kakepuwatixe. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Tinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:16">2 Ko 7.16</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 5:10">Ka 5.10</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 4:10">1 Ts 4.10</ref></char></note> xokupa kapia kakakuaire sinie katikikiriai sie kakari, Kokaipae kakati sini paire atinuku sipaunuku. Pa xati sewai rania tini panumu kapia kireni kakakuai.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Kokaipae tinipo nanunanu taitaitikati, Xoiteue xuiapu xiri xouweniketaipo kapia xiri sipaunari, Kristusue sokisoki tumuna xu xemerotaipo kapia sipaunariwakuaire xinuku.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xokupa apimi tini saina ta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Yewapu xura<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:17">Mt 18.17</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 16:17">Ro 16.17</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 5:11-13">1 Ko 5.11-13</ref>;<ref loc="2TH 3:11-14">2 Ts 3.11-14</ref>;<ref loc="1TI 6:5">1 Ti 6.5</ref>;<ref loc="2JN 1:10">2 Yo 10</ref></char></note>, sikou Kokaipa, Yesus Kristusupo wenumurei sinie tini xosa sokisoki kuna ipaki kunaunuku, kireu xatasikimanae aini purineri pa kuna sinie tikiriai taiwopu xuweurouneria, tini weniki xetauro pura. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:16">1 Ko 4.16</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 3:17">Pl 3.17</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 1:6">1 Ts 1.6</ref></char></note> sipa, tini sinipo kapiani kutu taiwa. Sinie tini xeika purikiriai yause xosa, sini aini puriroukiri xana xuwe. <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Sinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2 Ko 11.9</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 2:9">1 Ts 2.9</ref></char></note> tini xuputikiropu xoye aini tekixe. Xuwe. Sini isayaxirounuku. Sinie tini xu tepi xirarinuku, sokisoki saina tinuku asau ukumu irereiwowoukiriai. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Sinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:4-6">1 Ko 9.4-6</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 1:6">1 Ts 1.6</ref></char></note> tini xosa xoye tepu xuweuwopinuku sie xuwe. Sini xoye tepinukuni kutu itouna pana sini tepu xuwe, pa amure, takieni asinaku kapia taiwakuaire sini ataritikinuku.<verse eid="2TH 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:11">1 Ts 4.11</ref></char></note> sipa, sini taki xeikani purikiriai yause xosa, tini ipaki katikinuku, apue saina tepu xiraxina paiya, nu xoye tepuwatixana xuwe xikiriai. <verse eid="2TH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Pana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:13">1 Ti 5.13</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 4:15">1 Pi 4.15</ref></char></note> kireu tini xosaupoe aini ouye purori sini pa kuna iyesinuku. Ninie kire saina terixe. Nini kireu apimi nikau xokupa sapire kunau xanauwopi saina kireni tineri, paiya ninipo sapi xuwe. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:11">1 Ts 4.11</ref></char></note> ximine Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusupo wenumurei sinie pa apimi mua sokisoki kuna ipaki kanikinuku, nini atinerini kutu misineri, saina tineri, nikou xoye sapini nepineri.<verse eid="2TH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Yewapu xura<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:9">Ka 6.9</ref></char></note>, tini kakixanari asinaku kapia kakepire ouyexaku. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Sinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:9-11">1 Ko 5.9-11</ref></char></note> mua xokupa kuna nakau xosa xayaukiriai kire apue taiwopu xuweuna paiya, pa apu ati tumuworinari tini weu xetauro purari, nuko kaketai kapiaure mayaxepina. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Paiya tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:14">1 Ts 5.14</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 3:10">Ta 3.10</ref></char></note> nupo xiwai xinari nanuwakuaire sini kunaukirixe. Xuwe. Sinipo xatasiki xinari, nupo nanunanu kutuwakuaire kuna tuwakuai.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue kuso kuna kaniketai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Kokaipa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:23">1 Ts 5.23</ref></char></note> nu xoukemu yorowopi kapia xotapa, nue sipesi kakatia tinie xokupa sapi xosa xotikikemu yoroni purakuai. Kokaipae tini xokupa xeika puropina.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:21">1 Ko 16.21</ref></char></note> Polu ye ikoini mua kuso kuna tini xosa xayaune. Ye nakau xayaunepa muanumu kuna xokupa nakau xosa xayauroune. Muaia ye yekuworitiai xupisui.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Sikou Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusue xousuaxati xouwesikirouna kapiae tini xokupa xeika puropina.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
